  "title": "Kartini",
  "summary": "Raden Ajeng Kartini was born in Mayong village near Jepara, Java, in 1879. She wrote letters in Dutch to friends in Holland protesting the treatment of women and of Javanese people, and founded a school for native girls. She married the regent of Rembang in 1903 and died in 1904 giving birth to her son.",
